WEBVTT

00:12.053 --> 00:14.389
♪ See the daylight ♪

00:15.223 --> 00:17.392
♪ Covering the sky ♪

00:18.852 --> 00:22.230
♪ Hear the wind say ♪

00:22.313 --> 00:26.484
♪ No matter what you do, my friend ♪

00:26.568 --> 00:29.195
♪ You know the world
Still needs your light ♪

00:29.279 --> 00:32.449
♪ Let it just shine ♪

00:32.532 --> 00:34.951
♪ You'll be free ♪

00:35.035 --> 00:38.204
♪ From all the things you used to be ♪

00:40.040 --> 00:42.042
[distant bell clanging]

00:43.626 --> 00:48.465
DOONA!

01:54.781 --> 01:55.782
Let's go inside.

02:16.636 --> 02:19.305
[emotional music playing]

02:44.581 --> 02:48.960
EPISODE 6

02:49.502 --> 02:50.461
[I-ra] Ha!

02:53.214 --> 02:54.382
All right. Mmm.

02:58.052 --> 02:59.053
[exhales]

03:00.221 --> 03:01.890
[yells]

03:01.973 --> 03:04.559
[grunting]

03:04.642 --> 03:06.936
[upbeat action music playing]

03:07.020 --> 03:08.438
[yells]

03:13.610 --> 03:14.652
[grunts]

03:18.198 --> 03:21.409
[yells]

03:22.869 --> 03:24.245
[pants]

03:24.954 --> 03:26.206
- [applause]
- [Jeong-hun coughs]

03:26.289 --> 03:28.333
[I-ra] Ah! Thank you!

03:28.833 --> 03:30.919
Thank you so much!

03:31.920 --> 03:32.921
Ah.

03:37.008 --> 03:38.384
Ah, wow.

03:38.468 --> 03:42.263
That was an amazing spar between us, huh?
I totally needed that workout.

03:42.347 --> 03:43.181
Hmm.

03:45.183 --> 03:47.393
- So how long have you been doing that?
- Jujitsu?

03:47.894 --> 03:49.479
That was my first session here.

03:50.021 --> 03:51.981
Mmm. You're pretty good, then.

03:52.065 --> 03:54.692
Hey, a few pointers.
Don't rely on your weight, okay?

03:54.776 --> 03:57.904
It's a matter of technique, not just using
your weight as your strength, you know?

03:57.987 --> 03:59.948
How do you beat a natural talent, right?

04:00.031 --> 04:01.074
You just can't.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.952
So, hey, don't get discouraged about this.
Just man up.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.870
Don't worry at all.
You're amazing at yoga.

04:05.954 --> 04:08.915
I've already seen how flexible you can be.
[chuckles]

04:08.998 --> 04:10.959
So are you gonna train at that club now?

04:11.042 --> 04:12.252
Yes. Why wouldn't I?

04:13.336 --> 04:14.754
I have to keep getting better

04:14.837 --> 04:17.340
because I want to beat up
my asshole ex-boyfriend, all right?

04:18.258 --> 04:19.217
[sighs]

04:20.468 --> 04:21.427
What's wrong?

04:22.262 --> 04:24.347
Why bother with an asshole
who cheated on you?

04:24.430 --> 04:25.348
Learn to move on.

04:26.349 --> 04:28.059
You can't fix someone like that.

04:28.142 --> 04:30.436
If they've hurt you once before,
they'll do it again.

04:31.854 --> 04:32.689
[scoffs]

04:34.274 --> 04:37.986
Well, actually, if you really wanna know
I don't want to fix him at all, okay?

04:38.069 --> 04:39.946
I appreciate it. [chuckles]

04:40.029 --> 04:41.531
I understand. [chuckles]

04:43.032 --> 04:44.284
- Jeong-hun.
- [Jeong-hun grunts]

04:44.367 --> 04:46.995
- [I-ra chuckles] Thanks for the advice!
- [Jeong-hun sighs]

04:47.078 --> 04:50.123
DREAM SWEET TO RETURN
AS FOUR-PERSON GROUP WITHOUT DOONA

04:50.206 --> 04:52.208
[indistinct background chatter]

04:53.084 --> 04:54.043
[chuckles]

04:55.670 --> 04:58.047
What could be more interesting
than your best friend, Won-jun?

04:58.131 --> 04:59.048
Your girlfriend?

04:59.132 --> 05:01.718
My Dream Sweet girls
are finally making their comeback.

05:01.801 --> 05:02.844
I'm so excited.

05:03.594 --> 05:06.597
Headlines are popping up,
so I was looking. I'm sorry.

05:06.681 --> 05:09.225
Is that other girl member,
Lee Doona, gonna be a part of it?

05:09.309 --> 05:11.227
I don't know. Just gotta wait and see.

05:11.853 --> 05:14.397
So, um, how's school been going, huh?

05:15.231 --> 05:16.607
Jin-ju, what's going on with her?

05:18.234 --> 05:19.986
So, uh, what kind of person is Lee Doona?

05:21.154 --> 05:22.113
Huh?

05:23.865 --> 05:24.991
[Kooksu chuckles]

05:31.414 --> 05:33.916
LEE DOONA
LEE DOONA WITHDRAWAL, MOM'S DEBT

05:36.210 --> 05:39.630
IDOL DOONA'S PUBLIC IMAGE TAKES A HIT
AS HER MOM'S 700 MILLION DEBT REVEALED

05:42.008 --> 05:43.843
ONLINE FORUM FLOODED WITH POSTERS

05:43.926 --> 05:46.763
CLAIMING TO HAVE BEEN DEFRAUDED
BY DOONA'S MOTHER

05:46.846 --> 05:48.848
[somber music playing]

05:50.099 --> 05:55.605
LEE DOONA'S MOM ALLEGED TO HAVE DEFRAUDED
VICTIMS OF OVER A BILLION WON

05:59.317 --> 06:00.985
DOONA'S PAINFUL PAST UNCOVERED

06:01.069 --> 06:03.488
RAISED BY GRANDMA FOLLOWING MOM'S DIVORCE

06:17.585 --> 06:18.586
[chuckles]

06:28.638 --> 06:29.597
[sighs]

06:33.810 --> 06:35.269
[line ringing]

06:43.444 --> 06:44.654
Hey, guess who.

06:45.905 --> 06:47.031
[Doona] Where are you?

06:47.698 --> 06:49.242
Outside a paper shop.

06:49.325 --> 06:50.410
[Doona chuckles]

06:51.702 --> 06:52.787
You sound drunk.

06:53.496 --> 06:54.872
[Won-jun] When I was little,

06:55.456 --> 06:56.749
my dad ran a paper shop.

06:56.833 --> 06:58.084
Do you know what that is?

06:59.419 --> 07:01.754
He sold wallpaper and paper flooring.

07:02.338 --> 07:03.506
He repaired lamps.

07:03.589 --> 07:05.174
He basically did everything.

07:05.842 --> 07:08.886
Back then, there were so many things
I wanted to do with him.

07:10.263 --> 07:12.014
But when my dad passed away,

07:13.182 --> 07:15.977
I lost interest in his work
and in other things.

07:16.686 --> 07:19.313
I didn't know
if I could be happy in my life anymore.

07:20.481 --> 07:22.150
I slowly became invisible

07:22.859 --> 07:25.278
and kept to myself as much as possible.

07:26.195 --> 07:30.408
But eventually, I realized
it wasn't what he would've wanted for me.

07:30.491 --> 07:33.244
I knew if he saw how I was living,
he'd hate it.

07:34.162 --> 07:36.622
If he was still here,
he'd tell me to stay strong.

07:37.123 --> 07:38.082
[chuckles]

07:40.376 --> 07:41.627
So…

07:43.838 --> 07:46.257
now I do my best
living life to the fullest.

07:50.386 --> 07:52.805
So what I'm trying to get at
is that I, um…

07:53.639 --> 07:55.099
I really like you.

07:56.017 --> 07:58.478
And I'm really jealous
of the people you've dated,

07:59.854 --> 08:02.023
so I really want to know all about you.

08:04.734 --> 08:07.278
That's how I really feel inside, Doona.

08:10.531 --> 08:12.241
[groans]

08:12.992 --> 08:14.660
I shouldn't have said all that.

08:16.370 --> 08:17.455
[bus departing]

08:17.538 --> 08:18.498
[panting]

08:19.415 --> 08:20.416
Uh-uh.

08:21.876 --> 08:22.710
I'm so sorry!

08:23.503 --> 08:24.670
Thank you so much, sir.

08:25.963 --> 08:26.839
Oh.

08:27.465 --> 08:28.382
[sighs]

08:30.343 --> 08:31.219
[exhales]

08:33.721 --> 08:34.931
[Doona] I wanna see you.

08:35.932 --> 08:36.807
Right now.

08:37.850 --> 08:39.143
[uplifting music playing]

08:54.033 --> 08:54.992
[grunts]

08:57.203 --> 08:58.287
[gate squeaks]

09:02.124 --> 09:03.042
[sighs]

09:17.890 --> 09:18.849
[sighs]

09:34.115 --> 09:35.616
You're actually here.

09:37.076 --> 09:38.536
I was hoping you'd come.

09:40.413 --> 09:42.206
Go back to sleep, okay?

09:46.627 --> 09:47.795
[Doona sighs]

09:50.298 --> 09:51.215
[Won-jun sighs]

10:16.240 --> 10:18.242
[emotional music playing]

10:50.191 --> 10:51.025
[Jin-ju] Ta-da!

10:51.108 --> 10:54.278
Whoa, sandwiches!
Whoa, why did you make so many?

10:54.362 --> 10:56.822
The bread was gonna go bad,
so I used it all.

10:56.906 --> 10:59.158
- Yeah, we brought them up to share.
- [Yun-taek] Ah, I see.

10:59.241 --> 11:00.368
[I-ra] Mm-hmm.

11:01.035 --> 11:02.536
- [Jin-ju] Thank you.
- Where's Doona at?

11:02.620 --> 11:05.164
Uh, so it looked like she
was still resting in her room,

11:05.247 --> 11:06.874
and we didn't want to wake her up.

11:06.957 --> 11:08.334
[door closes]

11:16.759 --> 11:17.635
Hmm?

11:18.260 --> 11:19.845
[footsteps approaching]

11:29.146 --> 11:30.398
So what's this?

11:31.399 --> 11:32.525
Wait a minute.

11:32.608 --> 11:35.361
So are you guys sleeping with each other?
Are you're dating Doona?

11:38.989 --> 11:40.908
Well, so I really like her.

11:41.867 --> 11:42.785
I like her a lot.

11:49.750 --> 11:50.751
[Yun-taek sighs]

11:56.590 --> 11:59.176
So I wonder how long
has this been going on, you know?

11:59.260 --> 12:02.304
She walked out of his room casually,
like it was old news, and we had no idea.

12:02.388 --> 12:04.390
Wow, what a traitor he is.

12:04.473 --> 12:05.891
[I-ra] I know. For real. Ugh.

12:05.975 --> 12:09.353
I once asked him
if they were dating before too, hmm.

12:09.437 --> 12:11.981
"So I really like her."
What?! Dude, what is that?

12:12.732 --> 12:16.193
So they're sleeping together
but not dating, so it's more casual.

12:16.277 --> 12:19.238
So I think it's kind of hip,
don't you agree?

12:19.321 --> 12:21.157
- Like on those TV shows.
- [I-ra sighs]

12:21.240 --> 12:23.617
No, that's not Won-jun's kind of thing.

12:28.998 --> 12:30.499
So, what do you think of all this?

12:30.583 --> 12:33.461
Do you think they are dating
or just sleeping with each other, hmm?

12:33.544 --> 12:36.005
My opinion is it's a violation
of the rules of the house.

12:36.088 --> 12:37.798
I should've said something.

12:38.674 --> 12:40.092
Man, you're no fun at all.

12:41.844 --> 12:43.220
[chuckles]

12:43.304 --> 12:45.264
- How do live with that guy?
- That guy?

12:45.347 --> 12:47.808
He's a pretty big jerk.
I told you. I'm sick of him.

13:04.950 --> 13:05.826
You gained weight.

13:15.085 --> 13:16.879
Does your stylist live with you?

13:19.757 --> 13:21.383
No, just a couple friends.

13:21.467 --> 13:22.802
You? [chuckles]

13:22.885 --> 13:24.637
Since when do you have friends?

13:25.596 --> 13:26.472
I do now.

13:27.681 --> 13:28.724
Why are you here?

13:29.809 --> 13:32.561
I heard the other girl members
are returning soon.

13:32.645 --> 13:34.480
Are you going to sit and do nothing?

13:35.064 --> 13:36.398
Why? Are you worried?

13:36.899 --> 13:38.567
You should get what you're owed.

13:39.068 --> 13:40.486
There's money left right?

13:40.569 --> 13:42.196
I'm not owed anything.

13:42.279 --> 13:44.740
I got it all,
then gave everything I had to you.

13:45.241 --> 13:47.910
I'm not even sure how much that was,
because you lost it all.

13:50.329 --> 13:52.164
Well, that's more reason to go back

13:52.248 --> 13:53.666
and beg the girls.

13:54.750 --> 13:55.584
[sighs]

13:56.418 --> 13:59.630
Mom, do you have any idea
why I might've quit?

13:59.713 --> 14:01.423
Aren't you curious to know?

14:01.507 --> 14:03.467
No, because I already know how you are.

14:05.010 --> 14:08.514
You have no work ethic at all.
You have a shit temper, Doona.

14:08.597 --> 14:10.432
And you constantly
turn people against you.

14:14.937 --> 14:16.939
[gentle music playing]

14:23.445 --> 14:25.865
- [man] Is Alice sick?
- I'm sorry, sir?

14:25.948 --> 14:28.659
[man] Jin-ju, she called out of work
today. She didn't tell you?

14:29.159 --> 14:29.994
Oh.

14:30.911 --> 14:32.621
Right. No, she didn't.

14:32.705 --> 14:35.416
I hope she's all right.
This is not like her.

14:42.631 --> 14:44.592
- Hello, welcome.
- [girl] Hello.

14:45.217 --> 14:47.219
[indistinct background chatter]

15:05.779 --> 15:08.782
10 YEARS LATER GROUND

15:18.000 --> 15:20.002
[phone ringing]

15:22.129 --> 15:23.672
KIM JIN-JU

15:26.091 --> 15:27.134
[sighs]

15:32.181 --> 15:33.182
Uh, hello?

15:35.726 --> 15:36.560
[Jin-ju] Sorry.

15:37.436 --> 15:39.355
Today must've been tough on your own.

15:40.105 --> 15:42.483
Um, no, it was actually kind of slow.

15:43.442 --> 15:46.028
[Jin-ju] I heard that there are
supposed to be fireworks tonight.

15:46.111 --> 15:49.156
- Hey, Jin-ju, I, uh…
- [Jin-ju] Wanna watch them with me?

15:51.158 --> 15:52.451
Just come with me.

15:53.369 --> 15:54.745
I have something to tell you.

15:57.247 --> 15:58.332
Please just come.

15:59.667 --> 16:00.668
[line beeps]

16:06.882 --> 16:09.301
Ugh, fireworks?
What are we, children? Seriously.

16:10.094 --> 16:12.638
Hey, shut up.
It's about to start soon, okay?

16:12.721 --> 16:15.724
Anyways, for your information,
I have melancholic depression.

16:16.225 --> 16:17.476
Melancholic depression? Why?

16:17.559 --> 16:20.604
The guy that I hope to date
has no interest in me whatsoever.

16:20.688 --> 16:22.690
- Or so I think.
- [Yun-taek] Oh, really?

16:22.773 --> 16:24.900
- Wait, who is this guy?
- [fireworks exploding]

16:25.567 --> 16:27.653
- Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! They're starting!
- Oh! Oh man!

16:27.736 --> 16:29.780
- Oh, look! Look!
- They're starting now!

16:29.863 --> 16:31.657
Oh wow, that was a really big one.

16:32.282 --> 16:33.367
[sighs]

16:35.953 --> 16:37.955
[curious music playing]

16:46.213 --> 16:47.423
[chuckles]

16:49.049 --> 16:50.509
That guy you mentioned…

16:51.510 --> 16:54.680
Not that I know who you're talking about.
I don't know who this person might be.

16:55.347 --> 16:58.308
It's just, well, I think maybe
something traumatic occurred,

16:58.392 --> 16:59.768
like, you know, with other girls.

16:59.852 --> 17:01.979
So what if he lacks confidence now
because of that, huh?

17:04.440 --> 17:07.860
But I don't care about that.
I already think he's super cool.

17:09.403 --> 17:11.405
- Oh.
- Oh! Aw.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.700
- [fireworks exploding]
- [I-ra] Mmm.

17:15.284 --> 17:17.161
- Mmm!
- [Jeong-hun] Oh! That was pretty.

17:17.244 --> 17:18.620
[I-ra] So pretty.

17:18.704 --> 17:20.622
Oh! Man, what a show!

17:21.206 --> 17:22.541
Look, it's a heart! See?

17:22.624 --> 17:24.793
[indistinct background chatter]

17:28.714 --> 17:30.966
- [firework explodes]
- [girl] Wow!

17:39.975 --> 17:41.977
- [fireworks exploding]
- [crowd exclaiming]

17:55.365 --> 17:56.200
[Jin-ju sighs]

17:56.742 --> 17:58.118
Wow, it already started.

17:59.078 --> 18:00.871
[Won-jun] Isn't this
why you invited me out?

18:01.371 --> 18:02.956
[Jin-ju sighs] Yes, sorry.

18:03.624 --> 18:06.293
I asked you to come,
and I was the one that was late.

18:07.461 --> 18:09.505
Well, let's enjoy it before it ends.

18:10.380 --> 18:11.256
[Jin-ju chuckles]

18:12.841 --> 18:14.927
[fireworks exploding]

18:15.010 --> 18:15.928
[Jin-ju gasps]

18:16.970 --> 18:17.805
[sighs]

18:18.889 --> 18:20.349
[crowd exclaiming]

18:21.767 --> 18:22.768
[Jin-ju] Won-jun,

18:24.103 --> 18:26.188
I'm going to tell you something important,

18:26.688 --> 18:30.025
so don't look at me
and just watch the fireworks. Understand?

18:32.653 --> 18:33.654
[Jin-ju sighs]

18:36.573 --> 18:37.950
I like you, Won-jun.

18:41.495 --> 18:44.081
I told you not to look. [chuckles]

18:44.164 --> 18:47.709
- I need you to look at the fireworks.
- Oh, uh…

18:47.793 --> 18:50.921
Since the first time we met,
I've always liked you, okay? [chuckles]

18:52.172 --> 18:54.758
Ever since you helped me
with math in school. [chuckles]

18:55.342 --> 18:56.802
It's kind of funny, right?

18:56.885 --> 18:58.053
[crowd exclaims]

18:58.137 --> 18:59.471
[sentimental music playing]

18:59.555 --> 19:01.682
1ST PLACE YANGJIN HIGH SCHOOL LEE WON-JUN

19:09.398 --> 19:10.899
LEE WON-JUN

19:26.373 --> 19:28.458
[sentimental music continues]

19:28.542 --> 19:30.794
[rain pattering]

19:44.933 --> 19:46.101
[Jin-ju] Excuse me.

19:46.768 --> 19:47.603
Oh.

19:49.271 --> 19:51.690
So I heard you're good with math.
Is that right?

19:52.274 --> 19:54.067
Do you think you could help me with this?

19:58.864 --> 19:59.781
[Won-jun] Uh…

20:02.284 --> 20:05.412
In the inscribed quadrilateral A-B-C-D
shown in the diagram,

20:05.495 --> 20:08.790
find the length of side B-C
when side A-B is equal to…

20:08.874 --> 20:10.042
[Jin-ju] Oh.

20:11.043 --> 20:12.044
Use this one.

20:13.253 --> 20:15.422
[Won-jun] So the triangle…

20:15.923 --> 20:17.174
[rain pattering]

20:22.095 --> 20:24.848
- [car horn honks]
- Oh, I'm sorry. I gotta leave.

20:26.683 --> 20:28.977
Is it okay if I come to you
for more help later?

20:29.061 --> 20:30.479
Uh, yes, of course.

20:30.562 --> 20:33.357
OSEONG ACADEMY

20:34.399 --> 20:37.277
[Jin-ju] At a time when there was
so much going on in my life,

20:38.654 --> 20:41.240
talking to you
honestly felt like a breath of fresh air.

20:41.323 --> 20:42.783
[Won-jun] Rock, paper, scissors, go!

20:43.283 --> 20:45.702
[Jin-ju] And every day,
when we'd walk home together…

20:45.786 --> 20:47.454
[indistinct chatter]

20:47.537 --> 20:48.705
[Jin-ju sighs]

20:48.789 --> 20:51.750
…I would wish my house
was just a little farther away.

20:53.418 --> 20:56.255
My mind would always
be full of sweet thoughts like that.

20:56.922 --> 21:01.093
I would get butterflies in my stomach
every time I was around you,

21:01.176 --> 21:02.261
and my heart would flutter.

21:05.055 --> 21:07.557
[robotic voice] Three. Two. One.

21:08.058 --> 21:09.268
[camera clicks]

21:09.351 --> 21:11.353
[sentimental music continues]

21:14.147 --> 21:16.358
[Jin-ju] I felt like
we were one and the same.

21:17.192 --> 21:19.903
I like that. Soulmates, huh? [chuckles]

21:19.987 --> 21:21.530
[Jin-ju] I couldn't tell you how I felt

21:21.613 --> 21:24.116
because I was scared
things might get awkward between us.

21:28.704 --> 21:30.956
I was worried
it would ruin our friendship.

21:35.502 --> 21:37.004
OKAY, TAKE CARE

21:38.797 --> 21:42.050
I didn't have the courage
to tell you what was going on in my life.

21:43.885 --> 21:45.470
[fireworks exploding]

21:47.556 --> 21:49.558
[sentimental music continues]

21:52.227 --> 21:53.895
I know you've moved on already,

21:55.897 --> 21:58.275
I just want you to know,
or else I'll regret it.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.737
I really like you.

22:02.821 --> 22:06.908
I… I have always liked you
ever since I first laid eyes on you.

22:09.244 --> 22:11.079
And I still feel the same way now.

22:22.049 --> 22:23.550
[elevator dings]

22:27.304 --> 22:29.389
[pop music playing]

22:35.437 --> 22:37.814
[in Korean] ♪ I can hear the ticktock ♪

22:38.857 --> 22:40.942
♪ My look shines through ♪

22:42.110 --> 22:43.612
[in English] ♪ Look at you now ♪

22:44.363 --> 22:46.031
♪ Who cares? I'm a star ♪

22:46.114 --> 22:48.325
[in Korean] ♪ This here is my ground ♪

22:48.408 --> 22:51.703
♪ I dazzle as I run the show
Whatever others say, I don't care ♪

22:52.204 --> 22:54.164
[in English]
♪ Follow melodies to wonderland ♪

22:54.247 --> 22:56.583
♪ That you have wished for ♪

22:58.919 --> 23:00.670
♪ La papa loom pow ♪

23:02.506 --> 23:04.466
[in Korean] ♪ I'm sassy as I go my way ♪

23:05.217 --> 23:06.927
[vocalizing]

23:07.010 --> 23:09.221
[in English] ♪ I'm breaking my cage ♪

23:10.430 --> 23:12.682
[in Korean] ♪ Just follow my step ♪

23:15.727 --> 23:16.853
[in English] ♪ Let's dance ♪

23:27.114 --> 23:28.240
I've waited so long…

23:30.909 --> 23:32.869
to hear those words from you, you know.

23:33.703 --> 23:36.081
Ever since we became close,
I've always wanted this for us.

23:36.665 --> 23:37.833
I'm sorry that

23:38.500 --> 23:40.419
I was too young then to understand.

23:41.461 --> 23:43.505
I'm really sorry for always hesitating.

23:46.049 --> 23:46.967
And, uh,

23:48.218 --> 23:49.803
for not feeling the same way you do.

23:51.430 --> 23:53.390
[emotional music playing]

23:53.473 --> 23:55.434
[crying]

23:55.517 --> 23:57.936
Well, then I just hope
that Doona won't break your heart.

23:58.019 --> 24:01.398
[sobs] And even if she hurts you
and you're full of regret,

24:01.481 --> 24:02.816
I won't take you back.

24:02.899 --> 24:05.444
Lots of boys really like me, Won-jun.
You know that?

24:06.778 --> 24:07.779
I know that.

24:08.989 --> 24:12.075
You're the kind of girl anyone
would be lucky to have, Jin-ju.

24:14.619 --> 24:15.745
So now on,

24:16.538 --> 24:18.874
don't let anyone hurt you anymore.

24:20.542 --> 24:21.877
Not even your family,

24:22.502 --> 24:24.254
'cause you deserve better.

24:26.965 --> 24:29.384
And I'd like to say I'm glad

24:30.051 --> 24:32.137
you're standing up for yourself more now.

24:32.637 --> 24:33.763
It's wonderful.

24:33.847 --> 24:35.390
Don't change that.

24:38.226 --> 24:39.853
[fireworks exploding]

24:50.280 --> 24:51.990
[fireworks exploding]

25:02.792 --> 25:04.294
[Doona] It's all over.

25:07.506 --> 25:08.924
- [phone chimes]
- [sighs]

25:12.469 --> 25:14.888
[man] You came
to the showcase today, didn't you?

25:24.314 --> 25:25.649
[line ringing]

25:30.237 --> 25:31.780
[exhales]

25:35.742 --> 25:37.619
[robotic voice] The number
you're trying to reach

25:37.702 --> 25:38.828
is currently unavailable.

25:38.912 --> 25:39.829
LEE DOONA

25:39.913 --> 25:40.914
Please try again later.

25:40.997 --> 25:43.250
RECENTS

25:43.333 --> 25:44.251
LEE DOONA

25:45.043 --> 25:46.378
[line ringing]

25:50.173 --> 25:52.300
[I-ra] What are you doing?
It's the middle of the night.

25:54.719 --> 25:57.180
Nothing, really. What about you?

25:57.264 --> 26:00.141
Well, since you asked, I'm taking a walk
because I couldn't sleep.

26:00.225 --> 26:01.601
Then I saw you over here.

26:02.936 --> 26:04.563
You should go back inside.

26:06.147 --> 26:07.065
Hmm.

26:08.650 --> 26:09.484
Hey.

26:10.610 --> 26:13.071
So Jin-ju… she moved out.

26:13.738 --> 26:15.282
She moved to a studio.

26:16.283 --> 26:17.242
I know.

26:17.993 --> 26:19.661
It's all because of you, huh?

26:22.205 --> 26:23.206
[I-ra sighs]

26:25.333 --> 26:27.752
Where's Doona? Why isn't she back yet?

26:28.378 --> 26:29.921
I have no idea.

26:31.423 --> 26:34.217
She's your girlfriend.
You ought to know where she is.

26:35.719 --> 26:36.845
Girlfriend, huh?

26:40.223 --> 26:41.224
Is she not?

26:42.892 --> 26:43.810
Oh!

26:44.686 --> 26:47.230
Oh, you bonehead. Ugh.

26:49.858 --> 26:50.942
[I-ra sighs]

26:51.568 --> 26:52.402
Hey!

26:54.029 --> 26:55.196
Sit here.

26:56.573 --> 26:58.283
Come, sit. Hurry!

27:00.702 --> 27:01.578
[I-ra sighs]

27:07.626 --> 27:08.460
[Won-jun sighs]

27:08.543 --> 27:09.461
Lee Won-Jun.

27:10.128 --> 27:13.256
Do you know why couples
always celebrate things

27:13.340 --> 27:15.550
like anniversaries or romantic holidays?

27:15.634 --> 27:17.636
Because relationships are contracts.

27:18.136 --> 27:20.263
So it's normal to want to put
some kind of label on it.

27:20.847 --> 27:22.223
But in my experience,

27:22.807 --> 27:25.018
listening to your instincts
can help you a lot.

27:25.602 --> 27:27.312
There's got to be a reason
she won't commit.

27:27.395 --> 27:29.648
She's a celebrity after all.

27:32.651 --> 27:34.152
02:01 A.M.
SUNDAY, SEPTEMBER 17

27:34.235 --> 27:35.195
[sighs]

27:39.616 --> 27:41.868
Don't give away
more than you're getting back, all right?

27:42.452 --> 27:43.286
[scoffs]

27:44.704 --> 27:45.538
[Won-jun sighs]

27:46.289 --> 27:47.248
[I-ra sighs]

27:51.002 --> 27:51.878
How about a hug?

27:53.171 --> 27:54.297
No, thank you.

27:55.924 --> 27:56.800
[I-ra] Mmm.

27:57.676 --> 27:58.760
Okay, then.

28:02.055 --> 28:03.765
You got this! I know you do!

28:03.848 --> 28:05.809
Well, um… I'll go for now.

28:06.309 --> 28:07.310
Good night.

28:08.853 --> 28:09.688
All right.

28:13.066 --> 28:13.900
[I-ra sighs]

28:15.026 --> 28:16.778
Last chance for that hug…

28:16.861 --> 28:17.696
Hmm.

28:18.780 --> 28:19.739
[sighs]

28:26.204 --> 28:28.039
Well, it's your loss. [huffs]

28:33.628 --> 28:34.504
[sighs]

28:38.466 --> 28:39.843
[phone rings]

28:39.926 --> 28:41.636
LEE DOONA

28:41.720 --> 28:43.304
Oh, hey. Where are you?

28:54.941 --> 28:56.943
[sentimental music playing]

29:18.673 --> 29:21.551
[Doona's mom] Hey,
don't touch that cat. It's filthy.

29:22.260 --> 29:23.595
[cat meows]

29:28.641 --> 29:32.187
Hello? Are you here?
Yes, I'll be right out.

29:32.270 --> 29:33.897
No, I'm coming. Just give me a second.

29:33.980 --> 29:34.981
Okay Bye.

29:42.906 --> 29:43.823
[Won-jun] Doona.

29:46.534 --> 29:47.869
Why are you sitting here alone?

29:49.412 --> 29:50.747
Let's go on vacation together.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.957
- What?
- You don't wanna go?

29:53.666 --> 29:56.044
Uh, that's not it. Of course I do.

29:56.127 --> 29:57.253
Then let's go now.

29:58.546 --> 30:00.548
[emotional music playing]

30:39.796 --> 30:41.047
[Doona] Woo-hoo!

30:41.631 --> 30:43.091
- Hurry! Come on!
- [Won-jun chuckles]

30:44.300 --> 30:45.468
Yay!

30:51.599 --> 30:52.433
[sighs]

30:54.602 --> 30:55.562
It's Won-jun, isn't it?

30:56.813 --> 30:58.106
Huh? Ah.

30:58.189 --> 30:59.524
[chuckles] Won-jun.

31:00.108 --> 31:02.610
Well, that's a possibility.
Statistically speaking, yes.

31:03.194 --> 31:04.821
[inhales] Okay, but look.

31:05.905 --> 31:07.740
You know I'm a psychology major, right?

31:07.824 --> 31:09.617
And when I start to

31:10.118 --> 31:12.537
really analyze
the multiple non-verbal signs

31:12.620 --> 31:14.038
that she keeps on giving me…

31:14.539 --> 31:15.540
[sighs]

31:17.917 --> 31:19.127
I think I'm the guy.

31:19.210 --> 31:20.086
Don't you think?

31:21.254 --> 31:22.088
[sighs]

31:24.007 --> 31:25.091
[Yun-taek sighs]

31:27.135 --> 31:28.011
[sighs]

31:28.511 --> 31:30.430
Man, I hope
it doesn't get awkward in here.

31:30.513 --> 31:32.807
You know, with all of us living here
under the same roof?

31:35.101 --> 31:36.978
[sighs] Choi I-Ra.

31:40.607 --> 31:42.567
[thunder rumbling]

31:42.650 --> 31:44.611
- [Won-jun] Whoo!
- [Doona] Woo-hoo!

31:45.153 --> 31:46.237
[Won-jun] Whoo!

31:46.738 --> 31:47.947
[Doona] Yeah!

31:48.031 --> 31:50.033
[upbeat music playing]

31:50.116 --> 31:51.409
[Doona] Yay!

31:53.786 --> 31:54.787
[Doona squeals]

31:56.581 --> 31:58.291
[Won-jun] Ah, this is so nice.

32:04.547 --> 32:06.299
[Doona laughs] Jeez! Hurry!

32:06.382 --> 32:07.550
[both laugh]

32:08.259 --> 32:09.844
- They're gonna kill us.
- [Won-jun] Ah.

32:10.428 --> 32:12.347
[Doona] Ah! Just ditch it here! Let's go!

32:12.430 --> 32:13.806
[Doona laughs]

32:16.017 --> 32:19.395
- [Won-jun] Ah, it's cold. It's cold.
- [Doona] This is crazy. Isn't it?

32:20.855 --> 32:21.856
[Won-jun] Oh. Ah.

32:22.482 --> 32:24.359
Doona, can I have another towel?

32:24.442 --> 32:25.526
[rain pattering]

32:25.610 --> 32:26.861
[grunts softly]

32:28.237 --> 32:29.072
Oh.

32:31.115 --> 32:33.451
[Doona] Hey, hey,
can you help me with this?

32:34.327 --> 32:35.536
[shivers] Hurry. Hurry.

32:36.663 --> 32:37.789
Take it off. I'm cold.

32:39.707 --> 32:40.875
[moans] Hurry.

32:47.090 --> 32:48.216
[Doona sighs]

33:55.158 --> 33:57.160
[emotional music playing]

35:02.475 --> 35:05.019
[Doona humming]

35:58.573 --> 35:59.574
[grunts softly]

36:13.171 --> 36:15.173
[Doona humming]

36:27.977 --> 36:29.020
[grunts softly]

36:30.021 --> 36:32.023
- [Doona continues humming]
- [sighs]

36:44.493 --> 36:49.081
[birds chirping]

36:55.129 --> 36:57.381
[emotional music playing]

36:57.965 --> 36:59.133
[Won-jun grunts softly]

37:01.761 --> 37:02.929
[chuckles]

37:05.348 --> 37:06.265
[sighs]

37:06.349 --> 37:07.600
[sighs]

37:32.333 --> 37:34.877
Jeong-hun! Jeong-hun! [chuckles]

37:34.961 --> 37:36.128
Oh! Hey!

37:36.212 --> 37:38.172
Wait. No, wait! Where are you going?

37:38.256 --> 37:40.591
We have to train together.
What, are you scared to lose?

37:41.425 --> 37:42.426
Bring it on, hmm?

37:44.428 --> 37:45.263
Hmm?

37:47.807 --> 37:49.558
[yells]

37:50.476 --> 37:52.478
[I-ra grunting]

38:01.654 --> 38:04.031
[romantic music playing]

38:12.915 --> 38:14.542
Train somewhere else, okay?

38:16.669 --> 38:17.753
[sighs]

38:24.385 --> 38:25.636
[I-ra] Jeong-hun, wait!

38:26.304 --> 38:28.889
Let's go eat. It's my treat.
Let's go together, yeah?

38:30.099 --> 38:31.600
Oh, come on. Let's go, Jeong-hun.

38:31.684 --> 38:34.312
No, wait. Let's order beef intestines.
It's on me. I'm treating you.

38:34.395 --> 38:35.980
- Ah, jeez.
- Hey, slow down, will you?

38:36.063 --> 38:38.983
Ugh, why did Won-jun have to be
friends with such a crazy girl? Seriously.

38:39.066 --> 38:41.027
I have something I want to say! Wait! Hey!

38:41.110 --> 38:42.445
[panting]

38:50.745 --> 38:51.787
Oh, what now?

39:09.638 --> 39:11.265
Hey, let's get out of here.

39:11.974 --> 39:14.727
Come on.
Let's go get those beef intestines, hmm?

39:17.605 --> 39:18.522
Ah.

39:20.941 --> 39:23.903
At this point, I don't have
any feelings for him at all. [sighs]

39:23.986 --> 39:27.073
But seeing him with someone else
really makes me want to snap his neck.

39:29.784 --> 39:32.703
We were together ever since we were kids.
That's eight years in total.

39:33.621 --> 39:35.331
That's eight years
I've wasted on that loser.

39:35.414 --> 39:37.124
Those years won't be returned to you.

39:38.250 --> 39:40.669
But you should try to get
the money he owes, if possible.

39:40.753 --> 39:43.172
Ugh. This really sucks.

39:44.131 --> 39:45.049
[Jeong-hun scoffs]

39:46.801 --> 39:47.635
Ah.

39:47.718 --> 39:50.930
I don't get people like you and Yun-taek.
You always fall in love, but

39:51.680 --> 39:54.517
you keep on chasing relationships
despite always getting hurt.

39:54.600 --> 39:55.976
Why not avoid all that?

39:56.977 --> 39:58.396
Well, um, you just don't understand.

39:58.479 --> 40:01.107
You don't choose someone to like.
It just happens to you.

40:01.190 --> 40:03.317
Kind of out of the blue
when you least expect it.

40:05.069 --> 40:06.529
You're right. I don't understand it.

40:06.612 --> 40:08.572
Yeah, well, I'm sure one day you will.

40:08.656 --> 40:09.824
Just wait and see, huh?

40:12.868 --> 40:13.869
Hmm.

40:13.953 --> 40:15.413
Go ahead. This is all ready.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.623
I have no appetite.

40:18.499 --> 40:20.376
You still should eat. Have some.

40:25.840 --> 40:26.674
Mmm!

40:26.757 --> 40:28.342
This place is great!

40:28.426 --> 40:30.428
What amazing food, right? Mmm!

40:30.511 --> 40:32.012
Here. Here. Mmm.

40:32.096 --> 40:33.180
Cheers!

40:36.058 --> 40:36.934
Ah!

40:37.435 --> 40:41.147
Mmm, this is so good!
I love it! I'm serious! [chuckles]

40:41.230 --> 40:43.691
Oh, lettuce! Mmm.

40:43.774 --> 40:46.235
I need some more lettuce
with this next one. [chuckles]

40:46.318 --> 40:47.278
[chuckles]

40:47.361 --> 40:49.864
- [I-ra] Why aren't you eating?
- I am. Look I'm eating. See?

40:49.947 --> 40:51.907
[I-ra] Mmm! Wow.

40:52.408 --> 40:56.412
The second bite was even better! Mmm!
This place is awesome! Insanely good!

40:56.495 --> 40:57.580
- Sorry, what?
- [I-ra giggles]

40:57.663 --> 40:59.623
- What are you saying right now?
- [I-ra] So good!

40:59.707 --> 41:01.208
Okay, slow down. Chew your food slowly.

41:01.292 --> 41:03.752
[I-ra] Do you even understand
how good this lettuce wrap tastes?

41:07.840 --> 41:08.883
[Won-jun chuckles]

41:16.807 --> 41:18.225
So when do we head back?

41:19.310 --> 41:21.770
Why? You wanna go home or something?

41:21.854 --> 41:24.064
Of course not.
I would much rather stay here.

41:24.982 --> 41:27.234
I actually wanna live here
with you one day.

41:29.653 --> 41:31.989
You actually want something for a change.

41:32.531 --> 41:33.741
I like hearing you say it.

41:34.950 --> 41:35.826
[Won-jun chuckles]

41:38.120 --> 41:39.788
So should we start dating for real?

41:40.789 --> 41:41.749
Like, go public, huh?

41:42.333 --> 41:43.459
Hmm…

41:46.462 --> 41:48.547
What? You look so worried.

41:48.631 --> 41:49.798
It's just, um,

41:51.091 --> 41:52.009
I can't wait!

41:53.010 --> 41:53.928
[Doona chuckles]

41:54.011 --> 41:55.012
[Won-jun chuckles]

41:56.347 --> 41:58.182
[won-jun] What should we make for dinner?

42:50.484 --> 42:52.736
[emotional music playing]

43:09.670 --> 43:10.713
[sighs]

43:16.802 --> 43:20.598
MSA HEAD OF TALENT RECRUITMENT
PARK IN-WOOK

43:25.477 --> 43:27.521
Hi. I want to be an idol.

43:28.647 --> 43:30.899
♪ Nobody could ♪

43:31.692 --> 43:33.152
♪ Ever ♪

43:34.320 --> 43:37.281
♪ Oh, I ♪

43:38.240 --> 43:40.993
♪ Wanted to laugh ♪

43:41.702 --> 43:45.414
♪ If I could be where that light is ♪

43:45.497 --> 43:48.542
♪ Just for one day ♪

43:49.501 --> 43:52.630
♪ Oh, I ♪

43:53.255 --> 43:56.258
♪ Wanted to say ♪

43:56.759 --> 44:00.012
♪ Only if you come to me and lie ♪

44:00.763 --> 44:03.182
♪ Down next to me ♪

44:04.475 --> 44:07.144
♪ Only if you give ♪

44:08.187 --> 44:10.189
♪ Only if you give ♪

44:42.012 --> 44:44.807
♪ Oh, I ♪

44:45.724 --> 44:48.644
♪ Wanted to laugh ♪

44:49.269 --> 44:52.940
♪ If I could be where that light is ♪

44:53.023 --> 44:56.193
♪ Just for one day ♪

44:56.819 --> 44:59.905
♪ Oh, I ♪

45:00.739 --> 45:03.534
♪ Wanted to say ♪

45:04.201 --> 45:08.122
♪ Only if you come to me and lie ♪

45:08.205 --> 45:10.582
♪ Down next to me ♪

45:11.792 --> 45:17.756
♪ Don't wanna hear ♪

45:19.049 --> 45:25.013
♪ Go on and see ♪

45:25.597 --> 45:29.226
♪ Do you think I have forgotten? ♪

45:30.519 --> 45:32.312
♪ Do you think? ♪

45:33.605 --> 45:36.233
♪ You think? ♪

45:40.154 --> 45:44.950
♪ Leave it to the breeze ♪

45:47.578 --> 45:51.874
♪ Let it all thaw ♪

45:55.085 --> 45:59.757
♪ Walking through the pouring rain ♪
